<title>UK: Credit Local adds 50 mln euros to Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local adds 50 mln euros to Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to  150 mlm euros from 100 million euros joint lead managers BIL and CCB  said on Friday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT  **150 MLN EURO  COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    20.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE  L-20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 SPREAD     +7 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 2002 AND 2003 OAT</p>
<p> NOTES     **LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY FOR 100 MLN EUROS ON 01.JUL.97</p>
<p>		*PAYABLE IN ECU UNTIL EMU.</p>
<p>		L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
</text>
